docs/CI.md	  - Anything the copy lacks, and any tag not listed, falls through to Docker Hub as before.	the release branch reworded these lines for the store Postgres shard (ebc19df31) and the mirror action's dockerd restart (d2945ecff, c1ab9b3df)
docs/CI.md	- [`base-image-mirror/action.yml`](../.github/actions/base-image-mirror/action.yml) runs before a job builds or pulls. It adds a loopback mirror over the copy to dockerd's `registry-mirrors` by a `SIGHUP` reload, which leaves service containers running. It pulls digest pins under their `docker.io` names, so a pinned `FROM` resolves locally, and tag pins from GHCR, retagged `<name>:<tag>`.	the release branch reworded these lines for the store Postgres shard (ebc19df31) and the mirror action's dockerd restart (d2945ecff, c1ab9b3df)
docs/CI.md	| `api` shards run only DSN-gated tests | `make test-report-pg-api`, [`scripts/pg-test-select.sh`](../scripts/pg-test-select.sh) | The unit run fails if a DSN-skipped test is outside the pick; every `pg` probe is picked |	the release branch reworded these lines for the store Postgres shard (ebc19df31) and the mirror action's dockerd restart (d2945ecff, c1ab9b3df)
